, 176, 240);\">4961点伤害</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">70%</span>的概率5秒强打（气绝，技能防御下降15%）。pvp的时候，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">80%</span>使生命值最低的三名敌人造成16秒魅惑（受到的所有buff无效化，只能被专用解除技能解除）</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ds(u)</div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\" class=\"td\">&nbsp;对生命值最少的三名敌人造成<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">7741点伤害</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">75%的概率</span>五秒强打（气绝，技能防御下降15%）。pvp的时候，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">85%</span>使生命值最低的三名敌人造成16秒魅惑（受到的所有buff无效化，只能被专用解除技能解除</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 43px;\"><td><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">队长技</div></td><td class=\"\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">敌人全体防御力下降10%（pvp的时候敌人全体debuff持续时间增加15%）</div></td></tr></tbody>\n                                    </table>\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>", "table_data": "[]", "status": 1, "uid": 0, "is_img": 0, "created_at": 1659686070, "updated_at": 1659728956}], "user": {"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 123153171, "content_num": 45, "read_num": 135566, "like_num": 59}, "update_user": {"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "re